    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_19#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 60,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_19",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hey, Barkeep, you got anything to drink?",
      "JA_current": "なあバーキープ、何か飲むものはあるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_20#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 63,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_20",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yep, I have. At my expense today. But remember: the first drink is for Serene.",
      "JA_current": "ああ、あるぞ。今日は俺のおごりだ。だが忘れんなよ、最初の一杯はセリーンに捧げるんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_27#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 84,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_27",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "At my expense today. Thanks and blessings to Serene.",
      "JA_current": "今日は俺のおごりだ。セリーンに感謝と祝福を。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "9",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barmen_call home_phr_0#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 26,
      "string_id": "bar_barmen_call home_phr_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Maybe you wanna give a ring as well? He-he.",
      "JA_current": "お前も一本かけてみるか？ へへっ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "14",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_21#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 66,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_21",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "For who?",
      "JA_current": "誰にだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_28#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 87,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_28",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Listen, Barkeep, what's the story out there in the Big Land?",
      "JA_current": "なあバーキープ、本土の方は今どうなってるんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "10",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barmen_call home_phr_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 29,
      "string_id": "bar_barmen_call home_phr_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What do you mean: \"give a ring\"? To the Main Land? That would be wonderful!",
      "JA_current": "「かける」って、本土に電話できるのか！？ そいつは最高だな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "15",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_22#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 69,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_22",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What, have you never heard about Serene?",
      "JA_current": "何だ、セリーンのことを聞いたことがないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_29#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 90,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_29",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Nothing special. Same old stories, and nothing different to expect in the future.",
      "JA_current": "別に何も。いつもと変わらんさ。この先も何も変わりゃしないよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barmen_call home_phr_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 32,
      "string_id": "bar_barmen_call home_phr_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, sure. Climb up onto the roof, then use the catwalk bridge to get to the next one. After that, go up the ladder there to the tower. Just make sure you don't break the bell when you ring it, ha-ha!",
      "JA_current": "ああ、もちろんだとも。屋根に登って、キャットウォークを渡って隣の屋根へ行け。そこからハシゴで塔の上まで登るんだ。鐘を鳴らす時はぶっ壊すなよ、ハハッ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "16",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_23#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 72,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_23",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, never... Who's he?",
      "JA_current": "ああ、一度もないな……誰なんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_24#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 75,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_24",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I have, I have... Give me the beer!",
      "JA_current": "知ってる、知ってるよ……ビールをくれ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_30#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 93,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_30",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Why? Have you had bad luck our there?",
      "JA_current": "どうした？ 外で何か嫌なことでもあったのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "12",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barmen_call home_phr_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 35,
      "string_id": "bar_barmen_call home_phr_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hey! Screw you, man.",
      "JA_current": "おい！ ふざけやがって。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "17",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barman_pivo_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1682,
      "string_id": "bar_barman_pivo_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Ohh, Marked One! That was the one and only stalker in the whole Zone to selflessly take care of others! He gave his own hard earned money to those who got robbed by bandits and even bought drinks on the house for everybody here in the Bar. One day he came up to me and proclaimed that he was going to the Monolith to ask for happiness for all people in the world. He left all his money and artifacts here and told me to wait for his return, and if he didn't make it back in a week - then I was to use his belongings to treat everyone in the bar with drinks in his honor. So, this is me complying with his final will.",
      "JA_current": "おお、マークド・ワン！ そいつはな、ゾーン中を探しても他にいない、見返りも求めず人の世話を焼くストーカーだったんだ！ バンディットに身ぐるみ剥がされた奴に自分の稼いだ金を恵んでやり、ここのバーにいる全員に酒をおごってくれたりもした。だがある日、世界中の人々の幸福を願うためにモノリスへ行くと言い出してな。金もアーティファクトも全部ここに預けて、「一週間経っても戻らなければ、自分の持ち物を使って店中の奴らに酒を振る舞ってやってくれ」と言い残していった。だからこうして、あいつの遺言を果たしてるってわけさ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_26#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 81,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_26",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Here you are.",
      "JA_current": "ほらよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "8",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barman_pivo_11#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1667,
      "string_id": "bar_barman_pivo_11",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You could say that. But that's none of your concern. Better have your beer and beg your fortune for a bit of luck yourself. That's how it is in the Zone: got back with the loot - that's a miracle, alive - lucky, a bullet just missed your head - good fortune, and the rest is destiny...",
      "JA_current": "まあな。だが、お前には関係のない話だ。さっさとビールを飲んで、自分自身の幸運でも祈るんだな。ゾーンじゃそういうもんだ。戦利品を持って生きて帰れりゃ奇跡、生きてりゃめっけもん、銃弾が頭をかすめただけなら大吉、あとは運命次第だ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "13",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_barmen_call home_phr_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 38,
      "string_id": "bar_barmen_call home_phr_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Take it easy, I was just kidding. Help yourself to a beer or something.",
      "JA_current": "おいおい怒るなよ、ただの冗談だ。ビールでも飲んで落ち着きな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_barman_pivo",
          "phrase_id": "18",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text:dialogs_bar_25#1",
      "source_table": "dialogs_bar_gameplay_text",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\dialogs_bar_gameplay_text.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 78,
      "string_id": "dialogs_bar_25",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Respect, man. Give me the beer!",
      "JA_current": "大した男だな。ビールをくれ！",
